libghostty-vt
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
vendor/libghostty-vt/ contains a pinned copy of libghostty-vt from the Ghostty
project (https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty), used as the terminal state
engine and VT parser. It is built from source at compile time and statically
linked.

